+    # C99-clean under a C++ compiler (checked), so it rides EXTRA_SRC into the
+    # nvcc line like crashit.c / impulse_wars_api.c. Blobs are not compiled in:
+    # pass env.blob or env.blob_dir at run time (mmap, never a baked building id).
